2026-09-24T03:35:25.0697433Z After setup, use your coding agent normally; run `dw status` after a change.
2026-09-24T03:35:25.0698245Z 
2026-09-24T03:35:25.0698402Z Useful when needed:
2026-09-24T03:35:25.0699072Z   dw explain                         Explain the latest change from local evidence, with no AI required
